## 1. The endpoint mapping and controller method

The URL mapping lives on the generated interface, not the controller. The controller class is annotated `@RequestMapping("/api")` and implements `OwnersApi`, whose `addOwner` carries the `POST /owners` mapping → combined path `POST /api/owners`.

