The `@Valid @RequestBody` is what triggers Bean Validation on the DTO (see section 2). The interface is `@Validated` (line 44). Note a `@Min(value = 0)` exists on path-variable IDs of other operations, but `addOwner` has no path variable.

Controller implementation — `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/OwnerRestControllerV1.java`:
- Class header, lines 54-57: `@RestController`, `@CrossOrigin(exposedHeaders = "errors, content-type")`, `@RequestMapping("/api")`, `implements OwnersApi`.
- Constructor-injected dependencies (lines 59-79): `ClinicService`, `OwnerMapper`, `PetMapper`, `VisitMapper`, `TelephoneNormalizer`.

The handler method, lines 106-144:
```java
@PreAuthorize("hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)")
@Override
public ResponseEntity<OwnerDto> addOwner(OwnerFieldsDto ownerFieldsDto) {
    HttpHeaders headers = new HttpHeaders();
    Owner owner = ownerMapper.toOwner(ownerFieldsDto);
    String normalizedTelephone = telephoneNormalizer.normalize(owner.getTelephone());
    owner.setTelephone(normalizedTelephone);
    owner.setEmail(normalizeEmail(owner.getEmail()));
    if (owner.getRegistrationDate() == null) {
        owner.setRegistrationDate(java.time.LocalDate.now());
    }
    if (isTelephoneInUse(normalizedTelephone)) {
        throw new DuplicateTelephoneException(
            "An owner with telephone " + normalizedTelephone + " already exists");
    }
    if (!Boolean.TRUE.equals(ownerFieldsDto.getSharesHousehold())
        && isHouseholdInUse(owner.getLastName(), owner.getAddress())) {
        throw new DuplicateHouseholdException(
            "An owner with the same last name and address already exists");
    }
    owner.setCustomerCode(nextCustomerCode(owner.getLastName()));
    this.clinicService.saveOwner(owner);
    OwnerDto ownerDto = ownerMapper.toOwnerDto(owner);
    headers.setLocation(UriComponentsBuilder.newInstance()
        .path("/api/owners/{id}").buildAndExpand(owner.getId()).toUri());
    return new ResponseEntity<>(ownerDto, headers, HttpStatus.CREATED);
}
```

The private helpers it calls (all in the same file):
- `normalizeEmail` (154-156): lower-cases email via `Locale.ROOT`, null-safe.
- `nextCustomerCode` (166-171): builds `<LAST3>-<NNNN>` where LAST3 = upper-cased first 3 letters of last name, NNNN = `findAllOwners().size() + 1`, zero-padded to 4 digits. This issues an extra `findAllOwners()` DB query.
- `isTelephoneInUse` (182-190): loads ALL owners (`findAllOwners()`), normalizes each stored telephone and compares — another full table scan.
- `isHouseholdInUse` (202-208) + `normalizeForHousehold` (218-223): loads ALL owners again; compares last name + address after trim, whitespace-collapse (`\\s+`→" "), and lower-case.

(There is a V2 controller, `OwnerRestControllerV2.java`, but it only exposes `GET` paging — no POST.)

